{
  "_comment": [
    "Estate Agent permission baseline. Merged into .claude/settings.json by",
    "`estate init`. Two principles: deny what cannot be undone, and stay out",
    "of the way everywhere else. A profile that interrupts constantly gets",
    "switched off, and a switched-off profile protects nothing.",
    "Run `estate doctor` to see which rules are actually costing you time."
  ],
  "permissions": {
